{
"text": "a bipartisan law",
"href": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/BLtW8t32UUo"
},
{
"text": "election denier",
"href": "https://www.rgj.com/story/news/politics/elections/2026/09/08/election-denier-jim-marchant-nevada-secretary-state-race/91598529007/"
},
{
"text": "end early voting",
"href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wO_F2WD-hGk"
},
{
"text": "even to save the life of the mother",
"href": "http://nevadaconcernedcitizens.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/VG-general-2016-Federal-State-4-pgs.pdf"
},
{
"text": "fought back in the courts",
"href": "https://news3lv.com/news/local/judge-rejects-federal-government-lawsuit-doj-nevada-voter-data-francisco-aguilar-las-vegas-reno-carson-city"
},
{
"text": "freedom to vote",
"href": "https://news3lv.com/news/local/nv-secretary-of-state-opponents-sharing-strong-differences-on-scotus-mail-in-ballot-ruling"
},
{
"text": "freedom to vote early, before Election Day by mail, or in a drop box",
"href": "https://news3lv.com/news/local/nv-secretary-of-state-opponents-sharing-strong-differences-on-scotus-mail-in-ballot-ruling"
},
{
"text": "has also said he would like to cancel every Nevadan’s voter registration and force them to re-register",
"href": "https://www.mediamatters.org/voter-fraud-and-suppression/nevada-radio-secretary-state-candidate-jim-marchant-said-he-supports-re"
},
{
"text": "he supports radical changes that would make voting less accessible",
"href": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2022-election/election-denier-jim-marchant-wins-nevada-republican-secretary-state-pr-rcna33638"
},
{
"text": "passing a bipartisan law",
"href": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/BLtW8t32UUo"
},
{
"text": "personally endorsed by Donald Trump",
"href": "https://x.com/VoteJimMarchant/status/2085389817853157520"
},
{
"text": "radical plan to completely destroy Nevada’s elections, and he would cancel everyone's voter registration and force them to re-register and end voting by mail.",
"href": "https://www.mediamatters.org/voter-fraud-and-suppression/nevada-radio-secretary-state-candidate-jim-marchant-said-he-supports-re"
},
{
"text": "still supports bans so extreme",
"href": "https://ivoterguide.com/candidate?elecK=696&raceK=2147&primarypartyk=R&canK=50551"
},
{
"text": "strip voting rights from millions of women",
"href": "https://www.lwv.org/newsroom/news-clips/save-act-how-donald-trumps-voting-bill-may-impact-2026-midterm-elections"
},
{
"text": "vote by mail",
"href": "https://nevadacurrent.com/2026/07/02/the-courts-wouldnt-end-nevadas-mail-voting-the-republican-secretary-of-state-nominee-would/"
},
{
"text": "voted against legislation",
"href": "https://www.leg.state.nv.us/App/NELIS/REL/81st2021/Bill/7741/Overview"
},
{
"text": "women’s health care and contraception",
"href": "https://doi.nv.gov/Healthcare-Reform/Individuals-Families/Preventive-Care/#AB_249"
},
{
"text": "“I’m still a staunch election denier.”",
